{"id": "34909", "title": "垂直打击", "author": "张嵩山", "category": "文学名著", "count": 99, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34909/34909s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34909.htm", "intro": "小说《垂直打击》以我军某空降部队所经历的野外生存、空降作战等故事为蓝本，惊心动魄地展示了宏大的战斗场面、空降兵的情感世界和远大追求，突出表现了我军官兵为打赢现代化战争殚精竭虑，实战演练的火热生活，同时也塑造了一群勇武过人、智慧超人、性格迷人的特种兵形象。小说围绕打赢未来战争这个严峻的历史课题，以独特的艺术手法展现了主人公胸中激荡的豪情壮志，为读者营造出“天下虽安、忘战必危”的紧迫感，让人们切身感受在新军事变革的脚步下,中国军人居安思危，时刻准备为保卫祖国统一、领土完整的强烈使命感……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34909", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2310088.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2310089.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2310090.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2310091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2310092.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2310093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2310094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2310095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2310096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2310097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2310098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2310099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2310100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2310101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2310102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2310103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2310104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2310105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2310106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2310107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2310108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2310109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2310110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2310111.ht